## Data Flow

### Typical Flow

```
┌─────────────┐
│  Component  │
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       │ calls hook
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│    Hook     │ ← uses tanstack-query
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       │ calls service
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│   Service   │ ← business logic & validation
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       │ calls DAO
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│     DAO     │ ← API calls
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       │ HTTP request
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│     API     │
└─────────────┘
```

### Direct Service Usage

Components can also use services directly (without hooks) when React-specific features aren't needed:

```
Component → Service → DAO → API
```

